== a_scale_of_dates_on_numbers
note: 1 row with NA in day or level dropped (line 4)
error[Z0401]: the `x` axis holds the numbers of `level`, which a scale of dates has no place for
 --> scripts/main.zeff:7:36
  |
7 | r.plot(x: level, y: level).scale_x(date)
  |                                    ^^^^ a scale of dates is for dates
  |
  = help: a scale of dates holds a Date or a DateTime variable; `date(v)` reads dates from text

== a_scale_of_dates_on_categories
