 --> scripts/main.zeff:7:13
  |
7 | p.vline(at: 3)
  |             ^ a number on an axis of dates
  |
  = help: write the date, as in `vline(at: date("2024-03-10"))`, or draw a line at each date of a variable, as in `vline(data: events, at: day)`

